Maintainer: Yi Liu <yi.liu.biostat@gmail.com>
Description: Provides methods for estimating average treatment effects in completely 
    randomized clinical trials using both unadjusted (Simple) and covariate-adjusted 
    approaches (ANCOVA, ANHECOVA, AIPW). The package integrates multiple variable 
    selection strategies (Lasso, adaptive Lasso, marginal correlation, and pre-testing) 
    and supports five missing-data handling methods. Additionally, the function 
    'CoadviseCAR()' implements covariate-adaptive randomization when defined by a 
    discrete or factor-type variable.
